    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha mbika ningī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lūngalūngaga nabo a Baisilaeli ūbawīle gīkī, ‘Īshi hū shene ī shigukulu shane īsho naamuhelelile; shilī shigukulu sha ng'wa SEEBA, īsho īng'wigeleelilwe mushikumūche gīkī shilī sha kwibilinga kwela.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jilīho shikū itandatū ījo muzunīlīgije kūtūmama milīmo, alīyo ū lwa mpungatī, ū lwene Sabato ya kwifuula; lūlī lūshikū lwa kwibilinga kwela. Yaya kūtūmama nīmo gose gose būlī kwene ūko mukūbiza; nguno īlī Sabato ya ng'wa SEEBA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pasaka na migatī ītī na shibimbya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shingī shiishi ī shigukulu sha ng'wa SEEBA īsho shihelilwe kūlwa kwibilinga kwela, būlī sheene mukūyūshikumūcha ng'wikanza lyasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Pasaka ya ng'wa SEEBA īkandyaga mhīndī ya līīmi līlīīlibīla, mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'inè ng'weji gwa kwandya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'weji gwa kwandya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu kabalīle ka ng'waka go Bayudaya, ū mu kabalīle ka Basukuma gūlī ng'weji go kadatū (Nsanò) kūjīlīīla mu go kanè (Kaboja).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'itanò ū mu ng'weji gwenūyo, shikandyaga ī shigukulu sha ng'wa SEEBA, ī sha migatī ītī na shibimbya. Ikanza lya shikū mpungatī mukūlya migatī ītī na shibimbya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa kwandya ī shigukulu shenīsho, bizagi na kwibilinga kwela, hama yaya ū kwīta ī milīmo īyo mukīītaga na kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza lya shikū mpungatī mfunījagi ū SEEBA shitambò sha kūpemva mu moto. Hūna a ha lūshikū lwa mpungatī bizagi na kwibilinga kwela; nīyo hangī yaya ū kwīta ī milīmo īyo mukīītaga na kale.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Matwajo ga kwandya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla hangī ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Ūlū ng'wingīla ū mu sī īyo nalīng'winha, hūna ng'wandya kūpandīka shilīwa kūfuma muyo, mukūyenha kūlī ngabīji shigabbu sha shilīwa īsho mulayūgesa kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shigabbu shenīsho akūshiyengeeja ū ngabīji kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, gīkī ī shilīwa shanukūlwe kūlwa nguno ying'we; akūshiyengeeja ha lūshikū lwa gīkī Sabato yabītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa kūshiyengeeja ī shilīwa shenīsho, shiigelile ng'wenhe ng'holo ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; ībize ya ng'waka gūmò, nīyo ītī na būka, īfunyiwe kūbiza shitambò sha kūpemva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwīfunya hamò na shakwinha shayo sha būsu, kilo gītī ibīlī ja būsu būnogu būsangije maguta. Ī shenīsho shilī shakwinha kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, sha kūpemva mu moto kūlwa ng'waso gwawiza; mukūfunya na shakwinha shaho sha kūng'wiwa, liita gītī īmò ya divai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūlya ī shilīwa ī shipya mu nzīla yose yose gītī ya kūbeeja ngatī, nūūlū kūshilya shitaalī shidoto, nūūlū kūshihelemba na kwanikīlīja, kūshisha lūshike ū lūshikū lwa kūshenha kūlī Mulungu wing'we. Ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha kūshinga ho shikū jose, pyī ū mu shibyalīlwe shing'we īsho shiliza, hose hose ūko mukwikala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigukulu sha mifungo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwandīja ū lūshikū lwa kūshenha mu shigabbu ī shakwinha sha kūyengeejiwa, ū lūshikū lwa gīkī Sabato yabītaga, mukūbala mifungo migima mpungatī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hū kūhaya mukūbala shikū makūmi atanò kūshisha ū lūshikū lwa gīkī ī Sabato ya mpungatī yabītaga. Hūna mukūmfunīja ū SEEBA shakwinha sha matwajo mapya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hose hose ūko mukūbiza mukwikalaga, mukwenha ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA shigabbu shibīlī sha migatī ya kūbeejiwa kūfuma mu kilo ibīlī ja būsu būnogu bsanjiwe na shibimbya. Ī migatī yenīyo mukwīfunya kūbiza shakwinha sha kūyengeejiwa sha matwajo ga kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamò nī migatī yenīyī, mukūfunya ng'holo mpungatī, ja ng'waka gūmò būlī yeene, hama jitī na būka; na nzagamba mūūga, hamò na ng'ondi ibīlī. Jikwenhwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA kūbiza shitambò sha kūpemva, hamò nī shakwinha shaho ī sha būsu, nī sha kūng'wiwa. Pyī ī shenīshi shikūbiza shitambò sha kūpemva mu moto, kūlwa ng'waso gwawiza kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho mukūfunya ngulyati ya mbūli, ībize shitambò sha shibi; na ng'holo ibīlī ja shakwinha sha būsangī, būlī yeene ya ng'waka gūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūjiyengeeja ī ng'holo būbīlī wajo kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, jifunyiwe kūbiza shakwinha sha kūyengeejiwa, hamò nī migatī ya matwajo ga kwandya. Ī shenīshi shilī shakwinha sheela kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, nguno ya ngabīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo itanagi kwibilinga kwela, yaya ū kwīta ī milīmo īyo mukīītaga na kale. Ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha kūshinga ho shikū jose, pyī ū mu shibyalīlwe shing'we ī shose īsho shiliza, hose hose ūko mukwikala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ng'ūgesa ī shilīwa ū mu migūnda ying'we, yaya ū kūpūmbīlīja kūshisha kū mbīmbī ja malaale ging'we, yaya nū kūshishokeela īsho shilīsaagīīla ū mu magesa ging'we. Ng'ūlekeela bayūsoleela nabo a bahabī na bageni. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
