          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū lūshikū lw'ikūmi lwa ng'weji gwa mpungatī gwenūyū, lūlī Lūshikū Lw'isangī. Mukūbiza na kwibilinga kwela, shiigelile kwilecha nī sha kūyeja mīlī; na kūmfunīja ū SEEBA shitambò sha kūpemva mu moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo yaya ū kwīta ī milīmo, nguno lūlī Lūshikū lw'isangī; lūshikū lwa kūbeejiwa isangī kūlwa nguno ying'we, kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ose ose ū wa kūleka kwilecha ī sha kūyeja mīlī, akūkomanyiwa wīnjiwe ū mu banhū bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kwīta nīmo gose gose ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, nakūnkenaagūla wīnge gete ū mu banhū bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo yaya gete kwīta nīmo nūūlū hado. Ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha kūshinga ho shikū jose, pyī ū mu shibyalīlwe shing'we īsho shiliza, hose hose ūko mukwikala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īlī Sabato ying'we ya kwifuula; gwike shiigelile nū kwilecha ī sha kūyeja mīlī. Ī Sabato ying'we īkwandya līīmi līlīīlibīla ū mu lūshikū lwa kenda ū ng'weji gwenūyo, kūshisha tondo yaho līīmi līlīīlibīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
